<div class="text-center py-5">
  <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold"><%= ENV.fetch("APP_NAME", "IntentSpring Demo") %></h1>
  <p class="lead text-muted mt-2"><%= ENV.fetch("APP_TAGLINE", "") %></p>
  <p class="text-muted mx-auto mt-3" style="max-width: 620px;">
    Say the one thing you are reaching for in a sentence, pick a length and a tone, and get a guided script to
    read aloud or record for yourself, with the pauses marked, plus one small thing you could make afterwards.
    The AI never makes the art, never tells you how you are doing, and never treats any of this as therapy.
    Only your sentence is sent; nothing else about you.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-4 d-flex justify-content-center gap-3">
    <% if signed_in? %>
      <%= link_to "Go to my intentions", intentions_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
    <% else %>
      <%= link_to "Try it free", sign_up_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
      <%= link_to "Sign in", sign_in_path, class: "btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg" %>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>

<hr class="my-5 opacity-25">

<div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 760px;">
  <h2 class="h5 text-muted text-center mb-4">Example &mdash; three minutes, quiet</h2>

  <blockquote class="intention-quote mb-4">Mornings, again: ten minutes at the kitchen table before the day starts.</blockquote>

  <div class="script mb-2">
    <p class="script-text">Sit however you are sitting. There is nothing to fix about it. Let your hands rest where they landed, on the table or in your lap.</p>
    <p class="script-pause">[pause, 8 seconds]</p>
    <p class="script-text">You wrote: mornings, again. Say it once, quietly, in your own voice. Mornings, again.</p>
    <p class="script-pause">[pause, 10 seconds]</p>
    <p class="script-text">The house is still. The day has not asked you for anything yet. This is the part before it does.</p>
    <p class="script-pause">[pause, 8 seconds]</p>
  </div>
  <p class="text-muted small fst-italic mb-4">&hellip; ten more passages, about 340 words in all &hellip;</p>

  <div class="card making-card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
      <h3 class="h6 mb-2">Something to make afterwards</h3>
      <p class="small text-muted mb-1">Photograph &middot; One photograph of the table, taken from where you sit, before you stand up.</p>
      <p class="mb-0">Before you get up, take one picture of the table exactly as it is this morning. It only has to be true to this one morning.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="text-center text-muted small mt-4">
    AI-generated. A script for you to read aloud or record yourself; not therapy or medical advice.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="text-center mt-5 pb-4">
  <% unless signed_in? %>
    <%= link_to "Write your own script &rarr;".html_safe, sign_up_path, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
  <% end %>
  <div class="mt-3 text-muted small">
    Open source &middot;
    <a href="https://intentspring.com" class="text-muted">IntentSpring</a>
  </div>
</div>
